---
// Wordmark derived from the favicon: terminal chevron, the name and a blinking cursor.
---

<span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[0.95rem] font-medium tracking-tight">
  <svg
    aria-hidden="true"
    class="size-5 shrink-0"
    viewBox="0 0 32 32"
    fill="none"
    stroke-width="3"
    stroke-linecap="round"
    stroke-linejoin="round"
  >
    <path class="stroke-accent" d="M9 10l7 6-7 6"></path>
    <path class="stroke-accent-2" d="M18 23h6"></path>
  </svg>
  <span class="text-fg">
    leonkrix
    <span aria-hidden="true" class="cursor text-accent-2">
      _
    </span>
  </span>
</span>
